     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I think the link accidentally left out the last &quot;l&quot; in html.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/growth.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/growth.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427610803000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RW0Bk993Hfji4d9Wk4Anr\">http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/growth.html</a><br></div></div>"
