     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I did transpose the data to make the each time point a column yet I get an error<div><br><div><div>Error in lav_data_full(data = data, group = group, group.label = group.label,  : </div><div>  lavaan ERROR: missing observed variables in dataset: Time1 Time2 Time3 Time4 Time5 Time6 Time7 Time8 Time9 Time10 Time11 Time12 ipu_ind</div></div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>&quot;transpose&quot;?  Do you mean you tried to changed from long to wide format, so that each row is one person and each column is a repeated measure?  The transpose function<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> t() </font>does not do that.  As the error message says, it can&#39;t find those variables in your data set (try using<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> head() </font>to see what variables are in the &quot;transposed&quot; data set).  Perhaps you need to use the<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> reshape() </font>function, or the<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> melt() </font>and<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> cast() </font>functions from the reshape2 package.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427610803000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1P1BmGDHWGGxncBM4CF4Uv\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div><div><br></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
