     "\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">From: Terrence Jorgensen<br>\r\nSent: Monday, January 16, 17:58<br>\r\nSubject: Re: Latent Curve Modeling<br>\r\nTo: lavaan<br></p>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\"><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">The link you sent isn&#39;t opening. <br>\r\n</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\"></p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">I think the link accidentally left out the last &quot;l&quot; in html.<br></p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\"><a href=\"http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/growth.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/growth.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427610804000&amp;usg=AOvVaw340dtzecaZTPDv5lZ-ddd0\">http://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/growth.html</a><br></p>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\"><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">I did transpose the data to make the each time point a column yet I get an error<br></p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">Error in lav_data_full(data = data, group = group, group.label = group.label,  : </p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">  lavaan ERROR: missing observed variables in dataset: Time1 Time2 Time3 Time4 Time5 Time6 Time7 Time8 Time9 Time10 Time11 Time12 ipu_ind<br>\r\n</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\"></p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">&quot;transpose&quot;?  Do you mean you tried to changed from long to wide format, so that each row is one person and each column is a repeated measure?  The transpose function t() does not do that.  As the error message says, it can&#39;t find those variables in your data set (try using head() to see what variables are in the &quot;transposed&quot; data set).  Perhaps you need to use the reshape() function, or the melt() and cast() functions from the reshape2 package.<br></p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">Terrence D. Jorgensen</p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:left;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:25px;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black;background-color:white\">UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427610804000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1n9oAwwNah014CqDtQFKre\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a><br></p>\r\n"
